   "eligibilityDescription_md": "\n1. The applicant should be a sportsperson.\n1. The Athletes must represent Jharkhand in competitions recognized by national/international Olympic committees.\n1. The Athletes must have secured a medal or participated in such competitions.\n1. The record-setting athletes are eligible for additional cash incentives.\n1. Awards for one competition are based on the highest achievement if multiple medals are won.\n\n<br>\n\n"
  },
