   "detailedDescription_md": "The “Jharkhand Sports Excellence Cash Award Scheme to Players” was launched by the Department of Sports &amp; Youth Affairs, Government of Jharkhand. The scheme aims to provide cash awards to athletes for exceptional achievements in national and international competitions, as per the Jharkhand Sports Policy, 2022. Encourages sports participation and enhances Jharkhand&#39;s reputation nationally and internationally.\n",
